[TITLE]
;;Project Title/Notes
SWMM 5.2.4 dynamic-wave options together - noodl test fixture: InitDepth (J1), InitFlow (C3, and C6 which is adverse and is reversed), MaxFlow (C1), flap gates on C4, C6 (reversed, so it passes the file direction J5 to J3 only) and the FIXED outfall, two barrels (C3), a 0.05 m outlet offset (C1), conduit lengthening (C2, LENGTHENING_STEP)

[OPTIONS]
;;Option             Value
FLOW_UNITS           CMS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
LINK_OFFSETS         DEPTH
MIN_SLOPE            0
ALLOW_PONDING        NO
SKIP_STEADY_STATE    NO

START_DATE           01/01/2026
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2026
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2026
END_TIME             00:30:00
SWEEP_START          01/01
SWEEP_END            12/31
DRY_DAYS             0
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:01:00
DRY_STEP             00:01:00
ROUTING_STEP         5

INERTIAL_DAMPING     PARTIAL
NORMAL_FLOW_LIMITED  BOTH
FORCE_MAIN_EQUATION  H-W
VARIABLE_STEP        0
LENGTHENING_STEP     5
MIN_SURFAREA         0
MAX_TRIALS           500
HEAD_TOLERANCE       1e-12
SYS_FLOW_TOL         5
LAT_FLOW_TOL         5
MINIMUM_STEP         0.5
THREADS              1

